        <li>Interfere with website security or functionality</li>
        <li>Introduce malicious code, viruses, or harmful material</li>
        <li>
          Scrape, copy, or reproduce substantial portions of the website without
          permission
        </li>
        <li>Misrepresent your identity or affiliation</li>
        <li>Use our website or materials to compete unfairly with EverJourneys</li>
        <li>Attempt to reverse engineer website functionality</li>
        <li>
          Use the website in a manner that could damage EverJourneys or its users
